OL,3,GNEWSAM4 to shut for repairs to
OL,4,Astorm-hit electricity pylon
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stretch of the M4 is due to close
OL,7,Fwhile electricity equipment damaged in
OL,8,Fwinter storms is repaired.
OL,10,FScottish and Southern Electricity
OL,11,FNetworks (SSEN) said a tree fell on to
OL,12,Fan electricity tower in Winnersh near
OL,13,FReading in February.
OL,15,FA replacement pylon was built in July
OL,16,Fwith work to restring the tower with
OL,17,Fhigh voltage cables set to be carried
OL,18,Fout from Friday night.
OL,20,FSSEN described the operation as a
OL,21,F"delicate, precise task" which needed
OL,22,Fthe motorway to be closed.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
